  "principal_findings": [
    "Eligible US retail users currently have a regulated spot-margin short route through Kraken Derivatives US and Bitnomial, distinct from Kraken Borrow's purchase feature.",
    "US retail margin order requests require venue-qualified :BTNL pairs. Public metadata can verify route and precision; format validation cannot establish account routing or eligibility.",
    "US margin execution occurs on a separate Bitnomial order book. Existing standard Kraken XBTUSD OHLC is a reference-price source, not verified BTNL fills.",
    "Neither current US retail spot margin nor Kraken's US perpetual route is established as available throughout January–June 2026.",
    "Spot-margin liquidation may draw on collateral assets in the Kraken account. Internal VCAP labels do not create venue-level protection.",
    "The only new public API payloads acquired are small BTC pair and BTCUC product metadata responses. No funding, price, account, or market archive payload was acquired."
